                        <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Welcome to Booksy Store your trusted destination for discovering great books!&#xa;&#xa;At Booksy Store , we believe that every book holds the power to inspire, educate, and entertain.&#xa;Our mission is to connect readers of all ages with stories and knowledge from around the world. &#xa;Whether you&apos;re searching for bestselling novels, timeless classics, children&apos;s adventures,&#xa; or the latest in non-fiction, you&apos;ll find a carefully curated selection right here.&#xa;&#xa;MADE BY:&#xa;ROWAN MAMDOUH  2201501&#xa;NOUR  MOSTAFA  2200653&#xa;NADA  ATEF         2201032&#xa;MARIAM TARIQ  2201588&#xa;NOUR SALAMA  2201379&#xa;&#xa;Thank you for choosing [Bookstore Name]. Happy reading!"/>
